:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126045107,imgsize-312310.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[YouTuber Ross Creations under investigation for launching opossum in viral video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126045363.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[YouTuber Ross Creations faces backlash and an official investigation after a viral video showed him launching a wild opossum with a catapult. The incident, which occurred in Florida, has drawn condemnation from animal rights groups and prompted authorities to look into potential animal cruelty charges. The video has since been removed, and Ross Creations has not yet commented publicly.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/youtuber-ross-creations-under-investigation-for-launching-opossum-in-viral-video/articleshow/126045363.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/youtuber-ross-creations-under-investigation-for-launching-opossum-in-viral-video/articleshow/126045363.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-18T01:51:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126045362,imgsize-385071.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nick Reiner makes first court appearance wearing suicide prevention vest after parents’ murder – video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126045110.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nick-reiner-makes-first-court-appearance-wearing-suicide-prevention-vest-after-parents-murder-video/articleshow/126045110.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nick-reiner-makes-first-court-appearance-wearing-suicide-prevention-vest-after-parents-murder-video/articleshow/126045110.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-18T01:18:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126045110,imgsize-857612.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists baffled as sharks found swimming inside one of world’s most active underwater volcanoes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126043273.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scientists studying one of the Pacific’s most active underwater volcanoes were stunned to find hammerhead and silky sharks living inside its crater. Footage captured near the Solomon Islands showed the animals swimming through hot, acidic water previously thought uninhabitable. Researchers say the discovery raises new questions about how marine life survives extreme environments and adapts to climate stress.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/scientists-baffled-as-sharks-found-swimming-inside-one-of-worlds-most-active-underwater-volcanoes/articleshow/126043273.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/scientists-baffled-as-sharks-found-swimming-inside-one-of-worlds-most-active-underwater-volcanoes/articleshow/126043273.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-18T00:51:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126044928,imgsize-397799.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump travel ban: Who are exempt from the new visa rules? What about the fiancé visa?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace=