ements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126042299,imgsize-713502.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[When a teapot became Hitler: The bizarre billboard controversy that took over the internet]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126040985.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 2013 J.C. Penney billboard for a stainless-steel teapot resurfaced online after viewers likened its minimalist design to Adolf Hitler. The resemblance, driven by the kettle’s handle, lid and spout, was unintentional, the retailer said. The ad was pulled, the kettle sold out, and the episode became an early example of internet-driven visual controversy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/when-a-teapot-became-hitler-the-bizarre-billboard-controversy-that-took-over-the-internet/articleshow/126040985.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/when-a-teapot-became-hitler-the-bizarre-billboard-controversy-that-took-over-the-internet/articleshow/126040985.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-17T22:08:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126042008,imgsize-528070.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[After Karoline Leavitt, Marco Rubio's Vanity Fair photo goes viral: 'Quietly cries in the corner']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126041723.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Marco Rubio told Vanity Fair that he would not be contesting for GOP nomination in 2028 if Vice President JD Vance contests. Rubio said he will be supporting JD Vance. But it is Rubio's brooding photo standing in one corner that piqued the interest of social media. Rubio said Vanity Fair manipulated photos and quotes to make White House team lopok bad, as he supported Susie Wiles amid 'Trump alcoholic mindset' row.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/after-karoline-leavitt-marco-rubios-vanity-fair-photo-goes-viral-quietly-cries-in-the-corner/articleshow/126041723.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/after-karoline-leavitt-marco-rubios-vanity-fair-photo-goes-viral-quietly-cries-in-the-corner/articleshow/126041723.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-17T21:38:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126041801,imgsize-708033.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[ICE agents pin down pregnant woman to pavement in viral video, draws flak: 'She cant breathe, We kept yelling']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126041589.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-agents-pin-down-pregnant-woman-to-pavement-in-viral-video-draws-flak-she-cant-breathe-we-kept-yelling/articleshow/126041589.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-agents-pin-down-pregnant-woman-to-pavement-in-viral-video-draws-flak-she-cant-breathe-we-kept-yelling/articleshow/126041589.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-17T21:31:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126041589,imgsize-689012.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[“I will not be coming”: Inside the controversy surrounding Caleb Hammer’s Financial Audit invite and Frogan’s public refusal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126041164.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Caleb Hammer and Twitch streamer Frogan found themselves at the center of online debate after Hammer offered $20,000 for her to appear on his Financial Audit show. Frogan declined, saying the format felt degrading and misunderstood her situation. The exchange sparked wider discussion about creator income, harassment, and where personal finances belong online.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/i-will-not-be-coming-inside-the-controversy-surrounding-caleb-hammers-financial-audit-invite-and-frogans-public-refusal/articleshow/126041164.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/i-will-not-be-coming-inside-the-controversy-surrounding-caleb-hammers-financial-audit-invite-and-frogans-public-refusal/articleshow/126041164.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2025-12-17T20:51:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126041295,imgsize-36394.cms"/></item></channel></rss>